        "background": "light",
        "accent": "default"
      },
      "startDateTime": "2025-04-03T13:00:00-04:00",
      "excerpt": "Join our webinar on March 26th, 2025, at 1 PM to explore AI's impact on creator authenticity and learn strategies to maintain genuine influence in the digital age.",
      "dateLabel": "Thursday, April 3",
      "timeLabel": "1:00 pm EST",
      "intro": "AI is transforming content creation, offering brands and creators new ways to streamline workflows, enhance creativity, and scale content production. But with rapid change comes new challenges—how do you integrate AI into your marketing strategy while maintaining authenticity, protecting creator relationships, and ensuring responsible use? In this webinar, we’ll introduce #paid’s AI Principles—a framework designed to help marketers and creators use AI ethically, transparently, and effectively. You’ll gain actionable insights on how to work with creators in an AI-powered world, maintain trust with audiences, and ensure AI enhances creativity without replacing human connection.Join us as we explore how to harness AI’s potential while keeping authenticity, responsibility, and collaboration at the heart of your marketing strategy.",
      "bodyHeading": "This webinar will help you:",
